          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yili lilava lilago lie mihiga ni mihiga ku munyi. Ku lidiku lie likomi liu mweli gwa Saba, avandu va Isiraeli vosi navageni vosi avamenyaa hagati haavo, kuduuka vahonge lilia kandi vatakola miyinzi josi mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lidiku yilio muruka gulakolwa gwukuvatakasa kutura muvwoni vwavo kunangwa vaduuki kuva valahi imbiri wa Yahova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidiku yilio lilava lidiku litakatifu ligali, lilara lisabato, liokohonga lilia kandi lia mutakola miyinzi josi mba. Malago yaga galalondwa kazozo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi Munene, uwaviikwa ku makono nukuvakwa maguta kuva musaalisi muvogono vwa baba weve, alakola muruka gwilitakasa. Aliviika zinguvu ziu vusaalisi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi akole muruka gwukutakasa havundu Hatakatifu ligali, Lihema liosi Liukuvuganira mu na Yahova, uvwali, avasaalisi, kandi avandu vosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
